# Published as `.gitignore` in the public repository.
# Kept deliberately small: this tree ships sources and artifacts, not builds.
#
# Note there are no entries here for the private repository's operator-state
# directories. Those names are ALWAYS-fatal markers in the export's
# private-material scan, so writing them down here would refuse the export that
# publishes this file. The scan is the defence; a gitignore line never was.

node_modules/
dist/
target/
*.tsbuildinfo

.DS_Store
